    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakamba ne, Ya biebe, usumbe mulondo wa dima wakafumbabo kudi mufumbi; bikila bakulu ba munkatshi mua bantu ne bakulu ba munkatshi mua bakuidi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uye nʼabo mu tshibanda tshia muana mulume wa Hinoma, tshidi ku tshibuelelu tshia tshibi tshia Hâsita, ubambileku mei andi nkuambila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubambile ne, Unvuai bienu dî dia Yehowa, nuenu bakelenge ba mu Yuda ne bantu ba mu Yelushalema. Yehowa wa misumba, Nzambi wa Isalele, udi wamba ne, Monai, nentume makenga ku muaba eu; hunvua muntu yonso lumu luau, matshu andi neahate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua bakundekela, bakuvuisha muaba eu bu muaba wa bantu ba bende, bakuoshilamu nzambi mikuabo musenga wa manananshi, nzambi mene yakadibo kabayi bamanye, nansha bobo bine nansha batatu babo nansha bakelenge ba Yuda; bakûsha muaba eu tente ne mashi a bantu bakadi kabayi ne bualu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakuasa bitendelelu bia Bâla ha mutu ha mikuna bua kuoshilahu bana babo balume bu milambu ya kuoshila Bâla mu kahia, muanda undi tshiyi mubambile ne, Enzai, undi tshiyi mutele, undi tshiyi muele meji bua kuenzabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Yehowa udi wamba ne, Monai, mu matuku alualua kabena babikila muaba eu kabidi ne, Tofete, anyi Tshibanda tshia muana mulume wa Hinoma, kadi nebaubikile ne, Tshibanda tshia Kushihelamu Bantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenvuishe mei akuhungabo kudi ba mu Yuda ne ba mu Yelushalema mei a tshianana mu muaba eu; nembahoneshe ku muele wa nvita mu bianza bia bena lukuna babo ne mu bianza bia badi bakeba mioyo yabo; nenfile bitalu biabo kudi nyunyu ya mulu ne kudi nyama ya ha buloba bu bia kudia biai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nendishe musoko eu bu tshintu tshidi tshikemesha bantu ne tshia kubingila ne tuseku; muntu yonso udi uhitshilaku neabingile ne tuseku bua makenga onso adi aukuata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nembadishe munyinyi wa bana babo balume ne munyinyi wa bana babo bakashi; ne buonso buabo, muntu ne muntu, neadie munyinyi wa mulunda wandi, mu kutshintshimika kua musoko ne mu dikenga bidi bena lukuna babo, bobo mene badi bakeba mioyo yabo, babakengesha nʼabi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe, ushihe biebe mulondo au ku mesu kua bantu badi bakuha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ubambile ne, Yehowa wa misumba udi wamba ne, Nembutule bantu aba ne musoko eu bu mudi muntu ushiha mulondo wa mufumbi udibo kabayi bamanye mua kufumba bua kuikalau mujima kabidi; nebajike bantu mu Tofete bualu bua kakuena kushala munga muaba bua kubajika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa udi wamba ne, Nengenzele muaba eu ne bantu badimu nunku, nenvuishe musoko eu bu Tofete mene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nsubu ya mu Yelushalema ne nsubu ya bakelenge ba Yuda, nsubu idibo banyanga, neyikale bu muaba wa Tofete, nsubu yonso mene kuakadibo boshila bintu bionso bia mu diulu musenga wa manananshi ha mutu hai, kuakadibo bahongoluela nzambi mikuabo milambu ya bia kunua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Yelemiya wakafuma ku Tofete, kuakamutumabo kudi Yehowa bua kuambeye dî edi, ne wakimana mu tshiendelu tshia mu nsubu wa Yehowa, wakambila bantu bonso ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Edi ndî didi Yehowa wa misumba, Nzambi wa Isalele, wamba ne, Monai, nentumine ha mu musoko eu ne ba mu ntshiama yau yonso makenga onso anakubambila, bualu bua bakukolesha mitshima yabo bua kabunvu mei anyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
